    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, i guess. but it's not really something you can \"fix\" with a talk. it's more like i've just reached the end of my chapter. everything i used to value/care about is just gone. the world keeps spinning and getting newer and louder, but i'm just... stagnant. like a piece of old tech that doesn't work anymore. it feels like i'm just taking up space that could be used for something that actually belongs in this era.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
